WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.797
This diagram is a training illustration, not your house.

00:00:03.797 --> 00:00:06.644
USFA says find two ways out of every room.

00:00:06.644 --> 00:00:11.254
In this fictional bedroom the first labeled way is the hallway door.

00:00:11.254 --> 00:00:13.763
The second labeled way is the window.

00:00:13.763 --> 00:00:16.746
The meeting place is in front of this house.

00:00:16.746 --> 00:00:20.136
The picture is not a floor plan for your building.
